{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_15617a6394ec7fc373f5a4d86cf29bfb533d58964384f80a13323d5b2447f4a7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cdfee1e5b041dfd8a20f09b8e421371c7c5202f4471629241b0344299f2121e5"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"Training data was built by collecting GitHub code with StarCoder-style filtering, reordering files by intra-repo dependencies, repo-level minhash deduplication, and filtering low-quality code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2139a0e0303628af308709529a2fa96b713f0cdc278765da79fe5c538bd47281","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e0965a393876292cef9513fa1ff68cdee9550b431123ca55e155b4886f217607"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"DeepSeek Coder is a series of code language models trained from scratch on 2T tokens (87% code, 13% natural language in English and Chinese), offered in sizes from 1B to 33B.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2af58c2f12c526016fbcbed9c26511608dda3a30648957e92fcf60bb6df7db31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_464e1f66d50f6dfffca4ad07fd9503662d8e6a1846f1d50257d40a7b51ad1cb7","slc_e0965a393876292cef9513fa1ff68cdee9550b431123ca55e155b4886f217607"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"Pretraining uses a 16K window size plus an extra fill-in-the-blank task to support project-level code completion and infilling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70b9f42d2dea1889ad0566d14843c46f997ddd649a478c22d62212855950da86","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e2aa8f710612d48170c9ff05756ad7f096dbc1471e4c1db80398b5083d1c1f5"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"The tokenizer is a HuggingFace Bytelevel-BPE with specially designed pre-tokenizers; the README states there is no direct way to convert it to SentencePiece.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_790e1e8f928f3e77a6e70781d9c16e574b240ee70cdb0b68036f33daffed2e32","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_654c0f7d92ec018804b73932caf6d23150016ca112052683a8cf935e26c7128e","slc_7d4c32760732e0cbe4ff15af5cc068a8c7534be97bb09ed2e91004a84235c0c3","slc_b6a46d4f7b9023432f809d0a51d6a0049e6fa680f7222b7970e352d9d6dd3518","slc_f4d6e5127ca0a6c2b5b2c60de21ca568f3990306e057edbb6f07e8b867e63d0d"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"A finetune/finetune_deepseekcoder.py script supports DeepSpeed training; training data must be JSON lines with 'instruction' and 'output' fields, with DATA_PATH and OUTPUT_PATH specified.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_795d03b603224b187fb107323aeeb804ad453038eb67c16e21c28e318c42d08d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder@2f9fd85927c6 snapshot aa5921a58e7ce67b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b67078d2128c1df44115eae9a7a105f49eca627d6fb6fa7bd563335858fdfd01"],"source_ids":["src_cc5563571ec15770b20d47349e375aff"],"text":"Reported: DeepSeek-Coder-Base-33B leads CodeLlama-34B by 7.9% (HumanEval Python), 9.3% (HumanEval Multilingual), 10.8% (MBPP), and 5.9% (DS-1000); Instruct-33B outperforms GPT35-turbo on HumanEval.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:45:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_426f7d3852de408bb9b7ba2374cd51a8"}
